&= \frac{-6 \pm \sqrt{256}}{2} \\
&= \frac{-6 \pm 16}{2}.
\end{align*}
This gives us two solutions:
\begin{align*}
j &= \frac{10}{2} = 5 \quad \text{or} \quad j = \frac{-22}{2} = -11.
\end{align*}
